# Traditional spiritual, public domain.
{title: When the Saints Go Marching In}
{artist: Traditional}
{key: C}
{tempo: 120}
{duration: 150}

{start_of_verse}
We are [C]traveling in the footsteps
Of those who've gone be[G7]fore
And we'll [C]all be re[C7]united
On a [F]new and sunlit [Fm]shore
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
Oh when the [C]saints go marching in
Oh when the saints go marching [G7]in
Oh Lord I [C]want to [C7]be in that [F]number
When the [C]saints go [G7]marching [C]in
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse}
And when the [C]sun refuse to shine
And when the sun refuse to [G7]shine
Oh Lord I [C]want to [C7]be in that [F]number
When the [C]sun re[G7]fuse to [C]shine
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}
